    "schema:description": "Converted from DCAT to CDIF core profile by dcat_to_cdif.py. Mappings applied: dcterms:title to schema:name; dcterms:description to schema:description; dcterms:identifier to schema:identifier; dcterms:issued to schema:datePublished; dcterms:modified to schema:dateModified; dcterms:publisher to schema:publisher; dcterms:creator to schema:creator; dcat:keyword to schema:keywords; dcat:distribution to schema:distribution. Unmapped DCAT properties preserved (open world)."
